,\"children\":\"We redesign the infrastructure around how your business actually operates. Proper cabling, structured patching, managed networking, documentation and clear topology. When something breaks, you know where to look. When the business grows, the network grows with it.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://wa.me/254736194051?text=Hi%20Sonny,%20I%20read%20the%20network%20story.%20Our%20network%20has%20too%20many%20recurring%20problems.%20Let's%20talk.\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"className\":\"group flex w-fit items-center gap-2 border-b border-ink/30 pb-1 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest transition-colors hover:border-green hover:text-green\",\"children\":[\"Is this your problem? \",[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"width\":\"11\",\"height\":\"11\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 12 12\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"className\":\"transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"d\":\"M2 10L10 2M10 2H4M10 2V8\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":\"1.2\"}]}]]}]]}]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"article\",\"02\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-ink/10\",\"children\":\"$L1e\"}],\"$L1f\"]]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"proof\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"border-b border-ink/10 px-6 py-16 md:px-16 md:py-24\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L1d\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-6 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-green\",\"children\":\"The Proof\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-3xl font-serif font-semibold leading-[1.05] text-[clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem)]\",\"children\":\"Problems we turned into systems.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 max-w-xl leading-[1.8] text-muted\",\"children\":\"These aren't concept pieces. They're live systems built around real problems: trust, manual processes, fragmented information and inefficient ways of working. Hover to look. Tap to use.\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"border-b border-ink/1