)]\",\"children\":\"What does your daily chaos look like?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 max-w-xl leading-[1.8] text-muted\",\"children\":\"Three field reports from real businesses. If you recognize your own operation in any of them, the cure already exists.\"}]]}]}],[[\"$\",\"article\",\"01\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-ink/10\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid md:grid-cols-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-16 md:px-16 md:py-24 \",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"figure\",null,{\"className\":\"relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute -inset-4 bg-green/[0.06] blur-2xl\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"img\",null,{\"src\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dzyxm0rhg/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1786859643/frayed-cable-bundle_whifkh.png\",\"alt\":\"Manga panel of a frayed network cable bundle in a server rack\",\"loading\":\"lazy\",\"decoding\":\"async\",\"className\":\"relative w-64 border border-ink/20 shadow-[0_24px_70px_rgba(0,0,0,0.55)] md:w-80\"}],[\"$\",\"figcaption\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 flex items-baseline justify-between font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-muted\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Fig. 01 — The frayed cable bundle.\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-outline font-serif text-2xl italic\",\"children\":\"01\"}]]}]]}]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col justify-center px-6 py-14 md:px-16 md:py-24 \",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"delay\":120,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-green\",\"children\":\"Network & Infrastructure\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-8 font-serif font-semibold leading-tight text-3xl md:text-4xl\",\"children\":\"The Network Nobody Understands\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-10 max-w-md leading-[1.9] text-muted\",\"children\":\"The internet keeps going down, and every time it does, someone calls the same technician. Nobody knows which cable goes where. One switch has been added on top of another. A cable runs across a ceiling because it was faster than doing it properly. When the business grows, the network becomes harder to manage, harder to troubleshoot, and more expensive to keep alive.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-10 border-l-2 border-green pl-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-2 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-muted\",\"children\":\"The Cure\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-md leading-[1.8]\",\"children\":\"We redesign the infrastructure around how your business actually operates. Proper cabling, structured patching, managed networking, documentation and clear topology. When something breaks, you know where to look. When the business grows, the network grows with it.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://wa.me/254736194051?text=Hi%20Sonny,%20I%20read%20the%20network%20story.%20Our%20network%20has%20too%20many%20recurring%20problems.%20Let's%20talk.\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"className\":\"group flex w-fit items-center gap-2 border-b border-ink/30 pb-1 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest transition-colors hover:border-green hover:text-green\",\"children\":[\"Is this your problem? \",[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"width\":\"11\",\"height\":\"11\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 12 12\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"className\":\"transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"d\":\"M2 10L10 2M10 2H4M10 2V8\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":\"1.2\"}]}]]}]]}]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"article\",\"02\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-ink/10\",\"children\":\"$L21\"}],\"$L22\"]]}]\n13:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"proof\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"border-b border-ink/10 px-6 py-16 md:px-16 md:py-24\",\"children\":[\"$\",\